  <!--原中文: '用枪托作为钝器的突然袭击;成功会击晕一个目标，让他们晕眩一小段时间，也可以卸下他们的武器。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'A sudden attack using the pistol stock as a blunt weapon; successful attacks will stun a target, leaving them dazed for a short period, and may also disarm them.',更新于2026-02-14-->
